  - family-names: "Hynds"
    given-names: "Robert E."
    affiliation: "University College London"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2170-8791"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EpiCENTR-Lab/QDNAseq-Genome-Integrity"
url: "https://github.com/EpiCENTR-Lab/QDNAseq-Genome-Integrity"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - QDNAseq
  - copy number
  - genome integrity
  - low-pass whole-genome sequencing
  - stem cell quality control
  - sex chromosome ploidy correction
abstract: >
  A command-line pipeline for genome integrity QC from low-pass whole-genome
  sequencing BAM files, built on QDNAseq. Produces genome-wide copy number
  plots and per-sample QC summaries, with automatic sex-chromosome (XX/XY)
  ploidy correction so that normal samples of either sex sit at the expected
  diploid baseline on chrX and chrY.
